# Hosts an engineer-agent workspace may reach. Extended regex, anchored, one host per line.
#
# Deliberately minimal: enough to clone a repository and install dependencies, nothing more.
# Keep it that way -- every entry here is a host that a compromised workspace can send a stolen
# checkout to, so the question for anything new is "does the agent's job fail without it".

# GitHub: clone, fetch, push.
^github\.com$
^api\.github\.com$
^codeload\.github\.com$
^objects\.githubusercontent\.com$

# Python packages.
^pypi\.org$
^files\.pythonhosted\.org$

# Node packages.
^registry\.npmjs\.org$
